# Regenerable / heavy — never commit
.venv/
models/
__pycache__/
gen/logs/
gen/__pycache__/
standing-loop/*.log
standing-loop/state.json
standing-loop/retrain-*.log

# Real-speech + derived training data — LOCAL ONLY, never public
data/

# Retrain reports quote real dictations verbatim (you cannot review a false
# DELETE without reading the sentence it fired on). report-20260715.md was
# committed by mistake and had to be scrubbed from every branch and tag with
# a history rewrite. The loop writes a new one every Monday, so this rule has
# to live here rather than in anyone's memory. Metrics-only summaries are
# fine to commit; the reports themselves are not.
standing-loop/report-*.md
